translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_a918cab4:

    e "您想要再次收集帮助吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_f458d617:

    "伍尔顿摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_2918ad2e:

