translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_ee1d3c2a:

    e "茶,我敢肯定,如果它意味着 得到好茶,他会出卖他的灵魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_00491c87:

