translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_f4263f10:

    "当他说话时,是大吼大叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_81a205c2:

    w "你是谁,你想要什么[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_6501cbce:

    "哈斯凯尔在沃尔登的尖尖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_a6081ba7:

    h "我是哈斯凯尔,我也可以要求你做同样的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_8e01c9d3:

    h "从我的观点来看,我听到[e]的呼喊, 并看外面看什么看起来像绑架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_6b1a0150:

    "他把拇指指向桶里半满的草药。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_4334b4be:

