translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_f2229723:

    "伍尔顿仔细地看着你 从未完全离开哈斯克尔的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_f0721f37:

    w "他是朋友吗,小家伙?"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_33a4bfbb:

